== Other shaders ==
If you want to use a shader that's not selectable as a preset, you'll have to track down a player that uses it or dig through Discord and enter the ''shader'' and ''technique'' manually.
<br>You'll also have to set the alpha and shadow flags manually:

<span style="font-size:120%"><u>'''Deferred shaders:'''</u><br></span>
'''Alpha enum'''
*   0 - No transparency, one-sided.
*  32 - No transparency, two-sided.
* 128 - Transparency, one-sided.
* 160 - Transparency, two-sided.

'''Shadow enum'''
* 0 - Casts shadow.
* 1 - No shadow.
* 2 - Invisible, casts shadow.
* 3 - Invisible, no shadow.

<span style="font-size:120%"><u>'''Forward shaders:'''</u><br></span>
'''Alpha enum'''
*  16 - Transparency, one-sided.
*  48 - Transparency, two-sided.

'''Shadow enum'''
* 2 - Invisible, casts shadow.
* 4 - Casts shadow.
* 5 - No shadow.

